{
  "_about": "Weltzcraft merch: every product comes in every logo. A buyer picks product, color, logo and size. scripts/merch-build.mjs + scripts/merch_place.py turn this into placed print files, real Printful mockups (weltzcraft-site/img/merch/<product>-<color>-<logo>.webp) and Printful store products (weltzcraft-site/merch-catalog.json). 'tone' picks the logo file: light logos on dark goods, dark logos on light goods. 'width' = logo width as a share of the print area (times the logo's own 'scale'); 'top' = gap from the top as a share of its height; 'wrap' prints the logo twice (both sides of a mug). 'price' is US dollars; 2XL adds $2, 3XL adds $3.",
